  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1e6a99a7-063e-4057-8a41-ee5231ff48a5-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 177px;\" /></p><p>For no slipping,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>R</mi></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
